    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A surreal narrative driven simultaneous card  game about two siblings dealing with the death of their father.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503500/extras/4fb5e6aae3604b6b975af9e77cb25824.poster.avif?t=1749467957\" width=800 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503500/extras/4fb5e6aae3604b6b975af9e77cb25824.webm?t=1749467957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503500/extras/4fb5e6aae3604b6b975af9e77cb25824.mp4?t=1749467957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A simultaneous card game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Appa</strong> </i>is a unique rock paper scissor style strategy card game where you and your opponent both choose a card simultaneously trying to predict and out maneuver each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>Synergizers</strong>, <strong>Cards</strong> and <strong>Afflictions</strong> to defeat manifestations of grief and trauma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synergizers</strong> Affect the Cards. <strong>Afflictions</strong> Affect the user or the opponent.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503500/extras/b24b621a41db777fa93b1a55fc720e6e.poster.avif?t=1749467957\" width=800 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503500/extras/b24b621a41db777fa93b1a55fc720e6e.webm?t=1749467957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503500/extras/b24b621a41db777fa93b1a55fc720e6e.mp4?t=1749467957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost Any card on the screen, whether its yours or your opponent's deck, can be synergized.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503500/extras/811894fb3bf22b7d4e854439eca58681.poster.avif?t=1749467957\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503500/extras/811894fb3bf22b7d4e854439eca58681.webm?t=1749467957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503500/extras/811894fb3bf22b7d4e854439eca58681.mp4?t=1749467957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10,000+ move variations for you and your opponent each. They can range from cards that can destroy your opponent in one shot to cards that can change the meta of the game itself.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503500/extras/6af8e2a77bd326a5f2257cdaf6f55454.poster.avif?t=1749467957\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503500/extras/6af8e2a77bd326a5f2257cdaf6f55454.webm?t=1749467957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503500/extras/6af8e2a77bd326a5f2257cdaf6f55454.mp4?t=1749467957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the story and Experience a heartfelt narrative of how two siblings bond and grow after their lives gets thrown into chaos.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A surreal slice of life drama about grief and death</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varun and Arundhati, living in Canada, receive the news that their abusive father, a failed local theatre artist, has passed away. Along with it comes a letter addressed to each of them, triggering nightmares rooted in lifelong trauma and unresolved grief as their father return in his theatre Costume. Follow their\u00a0 journey as they struggle to make sense of their past and search for meaning and belonging in this Surreal Slice of Life drama. Eventually Both of them realize they are having the same nightmares and try to make sense of it by making the game in real life. Story is inspired by works of Charlie Kaufman and David Lynch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503500/extras/2f4248845f241b67df73e7dde20578f9.poster.avif?t=1749467957\" width=706 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503500/extras/2f4248845f241b67df73e7dde20578f9.webm?t=1749467957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503500/extras/2f4248845f241b67df73e7dde20578f9.mp4?t=1749467957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The art of Appa is made with an impressionistic cinematic blend of pixel art comics, cinema and animation integrating unconventional techniques to create a painterly, soft pixel art style. The Art direction is blend of Culturally Rich Indian Themes and Surrealism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
