ss through the story and Experience a heartfelt narrative of how two siblings bond and grow after their lives gets thrown into chaos.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A surreal slice of life drama about grief and death</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varun and Arundhati, living in Canada, receive the news that their abusive father, a failed local theatre artist, has passed away. Along with it comes a letter addressed to each of them, triggering nightmares rooted in lifelong trauma and unresolved grief as their father return in his theatre Costume. Follow their\u00a0 journey as they struggle to make sense of their past and search for meaning and belonging in this Surreal Slice of Life drama. Eventually Both of them realize they are having the same nightmares and try to make sense of it by making the game in real life. Story is inspired by works of Charlie Kaufman and David Lynch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503500/extras/2f4248845f241b67df73e7dde20578f9.poster.avif?t=1749467957\" width=706 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503500/extras/2f4248845f241b67df73e7dde20578f9.webm?t=1749467957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503500/extras/2f4248845f241b67df73e7dde20578f9.mp4?t=1749467957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The art of Appa is made with an impressionistic cinematic blend of pixel art comics, cinema and animation integrating unconventional techniques to create a painterly, soft pixel art style. The Art direction is blend of Culturally Rich Indian Themes and Surrealism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
